  "description": "You are a flame that is about to go out, quickly find the exit before time runs out!\n\nEach time you die you will learn more about wrong paths and possible right ones.\n\nYou really need to run and decide really fast, your flame won't last if you're slow in your decisions, but most importantly don't stop at all or your time will be even faster!\n\n• 30 Progressive Levels\n\n• Dark Musics\n\n• Quicky gameplay\n\n• Chaotic Scenario\n\nBe sure of your path, one wrong step and your fate is likely to be death!\n\nI told you to be quick!\n\nIf you like fast and frantic experiences this is probably the perfect game for you!",
  "description_short": "Being a Dark Flame, the flame goes out quickly, you will have little time to find your way out, be smart or learn fast!",
